title: Payload smuggled as an image with a paste lure
severity: high
score: 55
tags: filefix, cache-smuggling, malware-download
attack: T1027.006, T1204.004, T1564
description: A response served as an image is really an archive or executable, and the page
  gives FileFix/ClickFix steps. The browser cached a payload with no download prompt, for a
  later File Explorer or Run step to use.
---
// A payload served as an image ...
mislabeled_images
// ... on a page that tells the visitor to paste a command, or put one on the clipboard.
| where exists(filefix_writes) or exists(run_dialog_pages) or exists(clickfix_commands)
| project url, content_type, magic
